"Emoji that support skin tones show this tone by default. Emoji without skin "
"tone variants are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"Emojiji, ki podpirajo tone kože, ta ton privzeto prikažejo. Emojiji brez "
"različic tona kože niso prizadeti."

